{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danju</strong> is a pachinko game where you can gather tickets with unique effects to help you win bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161580/extras/a779a12b5485e0c3206ab3447c5c79ac.poster.avif?t=1763451253\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161580/extras/a779a12b5485e0c3206ab3447c5c79ac.webm?t=1763451253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for tickets with powerful synergies to boost your earnings even further; Some tickets will help you go slow and steady, or perhaps the risky tickets with big payouts are more exciting! Earn enough coins to acquire trophies and move up the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161580/extras/2ffcd390f144c362ff342a75f12ef4c0.avif?t=1763451253\" width=1300 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your marble launching skills with a variety of levels each featuring unique layouts, mechanics, and music; Adapt your playstyle and ticket strategies to overcome the various hurdles that the board-keepers throw at you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161580/extras/96820103337a854167359d587290fe01.avif?t=1763451253\" width=1300 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your hand at an endless run by playing through Arcade mode with infinitely increasing stakes and increasingly difficult challenges. Get as far as you can before the stakes get overwhelming, and see how your score compares to others on the global lea